    "detailed_description": "<h1>Main Game</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1>Drive Thru Prologue is a drive thru experience game. Its prologue version of drive thru game which represents main concepts of drive thru game.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3162780/extras/c3637330cbe539f90cc53c7d31b0f1b3.poster.avif?t=1740461913\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3162780/extras/c3637330cbe539f90cc53c7d31b0f1b3.webm?t=1740461913\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3162780/extras/c3637330cbe539f90cc53c7d31b0f1b3.mp4?t=1740461913\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Game Concept:<br>A simulation of running and expanding a drive-thru shop where players take orders, prepare various beverages and foods, manage supplies, and serve customers efficiently.<br><br><br>Gameplay Elements:<br><br>1. Order Taking:<br>   - Receive and input customer orders for both beverages and foods.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3162780/extras/9f0152cc785de2285b6fefc95b49e593.poster.avif?t=1740461913\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3162780/extras/9f0152cc785de2285b6fefc95b49e593.webm?t=1740461913\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3162780/extras/9f0152cc785de2285b6fefc95b49e593.mp4?t=1740461913\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>2. Preparation:<br>   - Choose the correct cup size and shape for beverages.<br>   - Prepare food items as requested.<br><br>3. Customization:<br>   - Customize your shop's brand name.<br>4. Payment System:<br>   - Process payments using cash, credit cards, or mobile payments.<br>   - Input amounts, provide correct change, and complete transactions accurately.<br><br>5. Supply Management:<br>   - Monitor inventory and restock supplies to keep the shop well-stocked.<br><br>6. Growth and Expansion:<br>   - Improve and expand the shop by upgrading equipment, adding new menu items, and opening new locations.<br>   - Invest profits wisely to enhance the shop's reputation and attract more customers.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3162780/extras/2d7f6fa3085ad9003e0863535ba4125b.poster.avif?t=1740461913\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3162780/extras/2d7f6fa3085ad9003e0863535ba4125b.webm?t=1740461913\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3162780/extras/2d7f6fa3085ad9003e0863535ba4125b.mp4?t=1740461913\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Objective:<br>Efficiently manage and grow the drive-thru, accurately fulfill orders, maintain adequate supplies, and build a positive reputation for your shop.<br><br>This game offers a dynamic and realistic experience of operating and expanding a drive-thru, managing a wide range of beverages and foods, handling diverse payment transactions, and ensuring a steady supply of goods.",
