ile payments.<br>   - Input amounts, provide correct change, and complete transactions accurately.<br><br>5. Supply Management:<br>   - Monitor inventory and restock supplies to keep the shop well-stocked.<br><br>6. Growth and Expansion:<br>   - Improve and expand the shop by upgrading equipment, adding new menu items, and opening new locations.<br>   - Invest profits wisely to enhance the shop's reputation and attract more customers.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3162780/extras/2d7f6fa3085ad9003e0863535ba4125b.poster.avif?t=1740461913\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3162780/extras/2d7f6fa3085ad9003e0863535ba4125b.webm?t=1740461913\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3162780/extras/2d7f6fa3085ad9003e0863535ba4125b.mp4?t=1740461913\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Objective:<br>Efficiently manage and grow the drive-thru, accurately fulfill orders, maintain adequate supplies, and build a positive reputation for your shop.<br><br>This game offers a dynamic and realistic experience of operating and expanding a drive-thru, managing a wide range of beverages and foods, handling diverse payment transactions, and ensuring a steady supply of goods.",
